# Per-domain transport map
# Format:  domain    smtp:[relay_host]:port
#
# Use this if different domains relay to different upstream servers.
# If all domains go to the same server, just set relayhost in .env
# and leave this file empty (but it must exist for postmap to build the db).
#
# Examples:
# example.com         smtp:[192.0.2.10]:25
# example.org         smtp:[192.0.2.10]:25